  "display_title": "Curse of the Saintess",
  "description": "Seyden is the captain of the Paladin’s Order, and it is one of his duties to protect Bellota, the Saintess of the Empire. However, his feelings for her go beyond what duty demands from him. When he discovers that Bellota has been cursed to need a man’s seed in her every full moon, he volunteers to be the one to spend those nights with her. Although Bellota treats Seyden coldly, his determination to protect her and find a way to lift the curse remains unchanged. Will he be able to break this curse before it breaks Bellota’s spirit?\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
